      Desc="使用基于物理的高光着色模型, 高光将根据金属度和粗糙度计算, 而不是Ramp.\r\n同一时间只能启用一种Feature.\r\n\r\n\r\nUsing the physically based specular shading model, the specular will be calculated based on Metallic and Roughness, rather than Ramp.\r\nOnly one Feature can be enabled at the same time."
   End Object
