   Begin Object Name="MaterialExpressionStaticSwitchParameter_35" ExportPath="/Script/Engine.MaterialExpressionStaticSwitchParameter'/Game/EnvSandbox/Materials/Functions/MF_MooaToonBaseInput_2.MF_MooaToonBaseInput:MaterialExpressionStaticSwitchParameter_35'"
      A=(Expression="/Script/Engine.MaterialExpressionConstant'/Game/EnvSandbox/Materials/Functions/MF_MooaToonBaseInput_2.MF_MooaToonBaseInput:MaterialExpressionConstant_15'")
      B=(Expression="/Script/Engine.MaterialExpressionStaticSwitchParameter'/Game/EnvSandbox/Materials/Functions/MF_MooaToonBaseInput_2.MF_MooaToonBaseInput:MaterialExpressionStaticSwitchParameter_17'")
      ParameterName="Enable Feature Distance Field Facial Shadow"
      ExpressionGUID=8A83BE6348E2630B65B9468723F97840
      Group="00 - Global Settings"
      SortPriority=70
      MaterialExpressionEditorX=-5984
      MaterialExpressionEditorY=-832
      MaterialExpressionGuid=5D27655F4FF4092E080FDDA8C4C36857
      Function="/Script/Engine.MaterialFunction'/Game/EnvSandbox/Materials/Functions/MF_MooaToonBaseInput_2.MF_MooaToonBaseInput'"
      Desc="使用距离场面部阴影, 通过将多个角度手绘的阴影形状烘焙为距离场, 可以实现完全自定义的阴影形状.\r\n必须先通过Houdini或资产右键菜单烘焙Face Forward Direction.\r\n距离场贴图的生成请参考: https://github.com/akasaki1211/sdf_shadow_threshold_map\r\n同一时间只能启用一种Feature.\r\n\r\n已知问题: 在Face Forward Direction/世界空间Z轴/光照方向处于同一平面时, 由于计算精度不足会出现瑕疵, 略微调整其中一个方向即可解决.\r\n\r\n\r\nUsing Distance Field Facial Shadow, it is possible to achieve completely custom shadow shapes by baking hand-drawn shadow shapes from multiple angles into distance fields.\r\nThe Face Forward Direction must first be baked through Houdini or the asset right-click menu.\r\nFor distance field texture generation, please refer to: https://github.com/akasaki1211/sdf_shadow_threshold_map\r\nOnly one Feature can be enabled at the same time.\r\n\r\nKnown issue: When the Face Forward Direction/World Z Axis/Light Direction are on the same plane, defects may occur due to insufficient calculation accuracy. This can be solved by slightly adjusting one of the directions."
   End Object
