      Desc="在没有ID Map或顶点色输入的情况下直接指定当前材质为脸或头发, 适用于脸和头发使用不同材质的情况.\r\n\r\n如果要使用发影(头发在脸上的投影)功能, 则必须正确设置脸和头发的ID.\r\n\r\n\r\nDirectly specify the current material as face or hair without ID Map or vertex color input, suitable for face and hair using different materials.\r\n\r\nIf you want to use the hair shadow (shadows of hair on the face) feature, the face and hair IDs must be set correctly."
   End Object
