      Function="/Script/Engine.MaterialFunction'/Game/EnvSandbox/Materials/Functions/MF_MooaToonBaseInput_2.MF_MooaToonBaseInput'"
      Desc="不透明度\r\n当材质混合模式为已遮罩时, 使用Dither模拟半透明, 不会有排序问题.\r\n当材质混合模式为半透明时, 使用透明度混合半透明, 可能出现排序问题.\r\n\r\nOpacity\r\nWhen the material Blend Mode is Masked, Dither is used to simulate translucency, and there will be no ordering problems.\r\nWhen the material Blend Mode is Translucent, use Alpha Blend transparency, and there may be ordering problems."
   End Object
