   Begin Object Name="MaterialExpressionScalarParameter_30" ExportPath="/Script/Engine.MaterialExpressionScalarParameter'/Game/EnvSandbox/Materials/Functions/MF_MooaToonBaseInput_2.MF_MooaToonBaseInput:MaterialExpressionScalarParameter_30'"
      SliderMax=255.000000
      ParameterName="Specular Color Ramp Index"
      ExpressionGUID=FF7D06B64768DF4414161390556D5B6B
      Group="11 - Specular"
      SortPriority=0
      MaterialExpressionEditorX=-5968
      MaterialExpressionEditorY=1616
      MaterialExpressionGuid=827FDC6747157F23A70BA2A2F01AB579
      Function="/Script/Engine.MaterialFunction'/Game/EnvSandbox/Materials/Functions/MF_MooaToonBaseInput_2.MF_MooaToonBaseInput'"
      Desc="选择使用哪个Specular Color Ramp.\r\n横坐标是根据经验归一化后的高光强度:\r\n\t- 0对应高光点边缘\r\n\t- 1对应高光点中心\r\nRGB通道的值为Specular Color.\r\n\r\n现在MooaToon使用Global Diffuse/Specular Color Ramps来描述表面的多光源着色结果, 这意味着使用同一套输入你既可以实现基于物理的着色, 也可以实现完全自定义的风格化着色.\r\n你可以在Project Settings > Engine > MooaToon中找到默认的Ramp Atlas, 其中存放了所有可供选择的Ramp, 要使用某个Ramp你需要在这里输入其Index.\r\n如果要添加新的Ramp, 请先将默认的Ramp Atlas复制一份, 然后在Project Settings中修改Ramp Atlas为复制的, 以避免在更新MooaToon的时候产生冲突.\r\n\r\n\r\nChoose which Specular Color Ramp to use.\r\nThe horizontal coordinate is the empirically normalized highlight intensity.\r\n\t- 0 is the edge of the highlight point.\r\n\t- 1 is the center of the highlight.\r\nThe value of the RGB channel is Specular Color.\r\n\r\nMooaToon now uses Global Diffuse/Specular Color Ramps to describe the multi-light shading results of the surface, which means that using the same set of inputs you can achieve both physically based shading and completely customized stylized shading.\r\nYou can find the default Ramp Atlas in Project Settings > Engine > MooaToon, which stores all available Ramps. To use a Ramp, you need to enter its Index here.\r\nIf you want to add a new Ramp, please first copy the default Ramp Atlas, and then modify the Ramp Atlas to be copied in Project Settings to avoid conflicts when updating MooaToon."
   End Object
   Begin Object Name="MaterialExpressionScalarParameter_3" ExportPath="/Script/Engine.MaterialExpressionScalarParameter'/Game/EnvSandbox/Materials/Functions/MF_MooaToonBaseInput_2.MF_MooaToonBaseInput:MaterialExpressionScalarParameter_3'"
      SliderMax=1.000000
      PrimitiveDataIndex=4
      ParameterName="Specular Ramp Offset Intensity"
      ExpressionGUID=A6698CA14A1979D40B55099519B61FB7
      Group="11 - Specular"
      SortPriority=63
      MaterialExpressionEditorX=-6464
      MaterialExpressionEditorY=2320
      MaterialExpressionGuid=A7DB2FEA4F757D0E1FEE749F28F0D55E
      Function="/Script/Engine.MaterialFunction'/Game/EnvSandbox/Materials/Functions/MF_MooaToonBaseInput_2.MF_MooaToonBaseInput'"
      Desc="Specular Ramp Offset Map通过偏移Specular Ramp RGB通道的横轴来精细控制Specular的形状.\r\n贴图的值:\r\n\t- 越接近0越难以进入Specular范围\r\n\t- 为0.5时没有影响\r\n\t- 越接近1越容易进入Specular范围\r\n颜色空间: 线性.\r\n\r\n受限于GBuffer位深, 在`Specular Ramp Offset Intensity`较小时Specular边缘可能出现锯齿.\r\n建议将`Specular Ramp Offset Intensity`设为1, 然后以下方式之一:\r\n  - 控制台变量`r.Mooa.SpecularColorRamp.UVOffsetMaxRange`\r\n  - `BP_MooaLookDevTool > Shading Settings > Specular Ramp UV Offset Max Range`\r\n调整最大偏移范围.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe Specular Ramp Offset Map provides fine control over the shape of the Specular by offsetting the horizontal axis of the Specular Ramp RGB channel.\r\nTexture value:\r\n\t- The closer it is to 0, the harder it is to enter the Specular range\r\n\t- has no effect at 0.5\r\n\t- the closer to 1, the easier it is to enter the Specular range\r\nColor space: linear.\r\n\r\nLimited by the GBuffer bit depth, Specular edges may appear jagged when `Specular Ramp Offset Intensity` is small.\r\nIt is recommended to set `Specular Ramp Offset Intensity` to 1, and then use one of the following methods:\r\n  - console variable `r.Mooa.SpecularColorRamp.UVOffsetMaxRange`\r\n  - `BP_MooaLookDevTool > Shading Settings > Specular Ramp UV Offset Max Range`\r\nto adjust the maximum offset range."
   End Object
   Begin Object Name="MaterialExpressionScalarParameter_29" ExportPath="/Script/Engine.MaterialExpressionScalarParameter'/Game/EnvSandbox/Materials/Functions/MF_MooaToonBaseInput_2.MF_MooaToonBaseInput:MaterialExpressionScalarParameter_29'"
      SliderMax=8.000000
      ParameterName="ID Map UV Channel"
