      Function="/Script/Engine.MaterialFunction'/Game/EnvSandbox/Materials/Functions/MF_MooaToonBaseInput_2.MF_MooaToonBaseInput'"
      Desc="在有ID Map或顶点色输入的情况下指定脸或头发的ID, 适用于脸和头发使用同一个材质的情况.\r\n\r\n如果要使用发影(头发在脸上的投影)功能, 则必须正确设置脸和头发的ID.\r\n\r\n\r\nSpecifying the ID of the face or hair with ID Map or vertex color input, suitable for face and hair using the same material.\r\n\r\nIf you want to use the hair shadow (shadows of hair on the face) feature, the face and hair IDs must be set correctly."
   End Object
   Begin Object Name="MaterialExpressionScalarParameter_26" ExportPath="/Script/Engine.MaterialExpressionScalarParameter'/Game/EnvSandbox/Materials/Functions/MF_MooaToonBaseInput_2.MF_MooaToonBaseInput:MaterialExpressionScalarParameter_26'"
