   Begin Object Name="MaterialExpressionScalarParameter_20" ExportPath="/Script/Engine.MaterialExpressionScalarParameter'/Game/EnvSandbox/Materials/Functions/MF_MooaToonBaseInput_2.MF_MooaToonBaseInput:MaterialExpressionScalarParameter_20'"
      DefaultValue=0.500000
      SliderMax=1.000000
      PrimitiveDataIndex=4
      ParameterName="Rim Light Width"
      ExpressionGUID=6C8E059A4613ACBE180360A0D9693F7D
      Group="12 - Rim Light"
      SortPriority=35
      MaterialExpressionEditorX=-6672
      MaterialExpressionEditorY=3184
      MaterialExpressionGuid=728763A045727CAD0EE253A37E11FCB2
      Function="/Script/Engine.MaterialFunction'/Game/EnvSandbox/Materials/Functions/MF_MooaToonBaseInput_2.MF_MooaToonBaseInput'"
      Desc="屏幕空间深度测试边缘光宽度.\r\n与传统的基于法线方向与视线方向的角度(N dot V)的边缘光不同, 屏幕空间边缘光的宽度与表面曲率无关, 看起来更加扁平化.\r\n可以用控制台命令调整更多全局参数.\r\n\r\n\r\nScreen Space Depth Test Rim Light Width.\r\nDifferent from the traditional rim light based on the angle between the normal direction and the view direction (N dot V), the width of the screen space rim light has nothing to do with the surface curvature and looks flatter.\r\nMore global parameters can be adjusted using console variables."
   End Object
   Begin Object Name="MaterialExpressionScalarParameter_2" ExportPath="/Script/Engine.MaterialExpressionScalarParameter'/Game/EnvSandbox/Materials/Functions/MF_MooaToonBaseInput_2.MF_MooaToonBaseInput:MaterialExpressionScalarParameter_2'"
      SliderMax=1.000000
      PrimitiveDataIndex=2
      ParameterName="Diffuse Ramp Offset Intensity"
      ExpressionGUID=F5C9260747001A6A63A63397CE933A03
      Group="10 - Diffuse"
      SortPriority=38
      MaterialExpressionEditorX=-6720
      MaterialExpressionEditorY=112
      MaterialExpressionGuid=CCAC52D145575B86CE3E0E8C3CF1F8B0
      Function="/Script/Engine.MaterialFunction'/Game/EnvSandbox/Materials/Functions/MF_MooaToonBaseInput_2.MF_MooaToonBaseInput'"
      Desc="Diffuse Ramp Offset Map通过偏移Diffuse Ramp A通道的横轴来精细控制法线阴影的形状.\r\n贴图的值:\r\n  - 越接近0越容易进入暗面范围\r\n  - 为0.5时没有影响\r\n  - 越接近1越容易进入亮面范围\r\n颜色空间: 线性.\r\n\r\n受限于GBuffer位深, 在`Diffuse Ramp Offset Intensity`较小时阴影边缘可能出现锯齿.\r\n建议将`Diffuse Ramp Offset Intensity`设为1, 然后以下方式之一:\r\n  - 控制台变量`r.Mooa.DiffuseColorRamp.UVOffsetMaxRange`\r\n  - `BP_MooaLookDevTool > Shading Settings > Diffuse Ramp UV Offset Max Range`\r\n调整最大偏移范围.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe Diffuse Ramp Offset Map provides fine control over the shape of the normal shadow by offsetting the horizontal axis of the Diffuse Ramp A channel.\r\nThe value of the map:\r\n  - The closer it is to 0, the easier it is to enter the dark side range\r\n  - It has no effect when it is 0.5\r\n  - The closer it is to 1, the easier it is to enter the light side range\r\nColor space: linear.\r\n\r\nLimited by the GBuffer bit depth, the shadow edges may appear jagged when `Diffuse Ramp Offset Intensity` is small.\r\nIt is recommended to set `Diffuse Ramp Offset Intensity` to 1, and then use one of the following methods:\r\n  - Console variable `r.Mooa.DiffuseColorRamp.UVOffsetMaxRange`\r\n  - `BP_MooaLookDevTool > Shading Settings > Diffuse Ramp UV Offset Max Range`\r\nto adjust the maximum offset range.\r\n"
   End Object
   Begin Object Name="MaterialExpressionScalarParameter_19" ExportPath="/Script/Engine.MaterialExpressionScalarParameter'/Game/EnvSandbox/Materials/Functions/MF_MooaToonBaseInput_2.MF_MooaToonBaseInput:MaterialExpressionScalarParameter_19'"
